- Report a Lightning receive that settles during a status lookup as settled
  `Wallet::lightning_receive_state` reads the settled record again when it
  finds neither a settled record nor a pending receive: a receive writes
  its settled record before it removes its checkpoint. A receive the wallet
  does not have returns `LightningReceiveNotFound`.
  [#21](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/21)
